{'sentiment score': 1, 'confidence': 10, 'reason': 'What are the effects of changes in valuation allowance for deferred tax assets on net income? First, increases in valuation allowance recorded to income tax provision result in a decrease in deferred tax liabilities. This means that net income increases as deferred taxes are no longer recognized. Second, decreases in valuation allowance recorded as a benefit to income tax provision also increase the amount of deferred tax liabilities, which reduces net income. Overall, changes in valuation allowance have a positive impact on net income when increases are recorded to income tax provisions and a negative impact when decreases are recorded as a benefit to income tax provisions.', 'company_name': 'COMPANY CONFORMED NAME:\t\t\tSurface Oncology, Inc.'}